    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3550" root="بوع" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَوْعٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُوعٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاعٌ</span>, in four places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  The
former also signifies <i>A place that is broken,</i> or
<i>crushed,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَانٌ مُنْهَضِمُ</span>,) <i>in a small ravine</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِصْب</span>)
<i>of a mountain.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, K.)

